 "posts": [
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: OCTOBER 28, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa October 28, 2026 (Wednesday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: October 28, 2026 (Wednesday)\nReason: Conversion of existing single - phase primary lines to three phase. \nTime & Affected Areas:\n7:00AM to 5:00PM\nPortion of AF6-Portion of Hda. Kasantolan, Purok Gensoli, Purok Canumayan, Brgy. Vesta Alegre , Bacolod City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
